  "changed_since_previous": "Rebased with updated test scripts and minor refactoring of the compile-time flag assertions; core approach is unchanged.",
  "card": "Allows transactions violating non-mandatory script standardness rules (such as OP_NOPx or OP_SUCCESS) to enter the mempool when running with `-acceptnonstdtxn=1` on test networks. Previously, testnet nodes with `-acceptnonstdtxn=1` accepted non-standard transaction structures but still rejected transactions that triggered non-mandatory script verification flags. The change also replaces a heuristic flag check in `CheckInputScripts` with an explicit block-versus-mempool enum and adds compile-time validation for consensus script flags.",
